  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As discussed after testing Digital Repository 2018 F3 dataset, the larger migration data validation could use a resume function similar to the migration utility to keep track which item it processed last so that if the validation process exited for any reason the process doesn’t need to be restart over again and can be resumed where it left-off",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
